        <details key="documentation" value="An absolute URI that is used to identify this code system when it is referenced in a specification, model, design or an instance; also called its canonical identifier. This SHOULD be globally unique and SHOULD be a literal address at which an authoritative instance of this code system is (or will be) published. This URL can be the target of a canonical reference. It SHALL remain the same when the code system is stored on different servers. This is used in [Coding](datatypes.html#Coding).system."/>
      </eAnnotations>
      <eAnnotations source="http:///org/eclipse/emf/ecore/util/ExtendedMetaData">
