      <eAnnotations source="http://www.eclipse.org/emf/2002/GenModel">
        <details key="documentation" value="The date  (and optionally time) when the library was last significantly changed. The date must change when the business version changes and it must change if the status code changes. In addition, it should change when the substantive content of the library changes."/>
