    <eAnnotations source="http://www.eclipse.org/emf/2002/GenModel">
      <details key="documentation" value="A signature along with supporting context. The signature may be a digital signature that is cryptographic in nature, or some other signature acceptable to the domain. This other signature may be as simple as a graphical image representing a hand-written signature, or a signature ceremony Different signature approaches have different utilities.&#xA;If the element is present, it must have a value for at least one of the defined elements, an @id referenced from the Narrative, or extensions"/>
    </eAnnotations>
